      "amount": "1 tsp",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "name": "fresh rosemary",
      "amount": "2 sprigs",
      "notes": " chopped"
    },
    {
      "name": "bamboo tray",
      "amount": "1",
      "notes": " used as vessel"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 180C and line a bamboo tray with parchment.",
    "Brew 200ml hojicha tea and let it cool to room temperature.",
    "Pat lamb leg dry, season with salt, pepper, minced garlic, and chopped rosemary.",
    "Coat lamb with olive oil, then place on bamboo tray and let rest for 15 minutes.",
    "Arrange sliced katsuramuki around the lamb and pour cooled hojicha tea over the roast.",
    "Roast in preheated oven for 90 minutes, basting every 15 minutes with tray juices.",
    "After 90 minutes, increase oven temperature to 200C and roast another 30 minutes until a thermometer reads 60C for medium-rare.",
    "Remove roast, let rest 10 minutes, then slice and serve with katsuramuki slices."
  ],
